Work with YouTrack issues

Usage:
  ytrack issue <command> [flags]
  ytrack issue [command]

Available Commands:
  attach      Attach files to an issue
  attachments List the attachments of an issue
  command     Apply a YouTrack command to one or more issues
  comment     Add, list, edit or delete issue comments
  create      Create an issue
  delete      Delete an issue
  download    Download the attachments of an issue
  edit        Edit an issue
  link        Link issues, or list an issue's links or the link types
  list        List issues
  unlink      Remove links between issues
  view        Show an issue

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for issue

Global Flags:
      --debug[=true|false]      Log HTTP requests to stderr with credentials redacted
      --host host               YouTrack host or service URL to use
      --no-color[=true|false]   Disable color output

Use "ytrack issue [command] --help" for more information about a command.
